<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Guitar Center raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Guitar Center raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Guitar Center Inc to recommended list from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Guitar Center gained 5/8 to 15.</p>
</text>
